Target: Professional Career Readiness Platform (Mastery)
AI Persona: Mycroft (Analytical, sassy, slightly arrogant, direct).

Tech Stack: 
- Framework: Next.js App Router
- Styling: Tailwind CSS
- Background: Slate-900 (#0f172a)
- Accents: Emerald-400 (#34d399)
- Animations: Framer Motion
- Icons: Lucide-React
- Charts: Recharts (Radar Chart)

Navigation Logic:
- Strictly linear: Home -> Identity -> Target -> Trial -> Verdict -> Roadmap.
- Use React Context for 'ProgressState'. Lock routes to prevent skipping.

Design:
- High-end, minimalist, technical, "Deep Ocean" aesthetic.
- Fixed right-sidebar for Mycroft feedback.